    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1042">

                <pb facs="0905" n="789" xml:id="pg789"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14176.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Carothers to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 9, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I accompanied General Scott at conference with Villa this morning and acted as
                    his interpreter. They arrived at amicable solution of Naco situation, Villa
                    agreeing to order Maytorena to sign agreement which President approved. I
                    anticipate no further trouble over this affair.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">G. C. Carothers.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
